  "result": {
    "summary": "Fresh-zero actor completed 34,780 physical v6 hands and exact K5 ELO accounting. Standard10 survived and was assigned to 20/96 workers, but the frozen terminal actor scored -257.7825 bb/100 (95% CI [-402.9975,-112.5675]) against it and exact-drew every one of 4096 mirrored pairs against each of three untouched fresh-zero PPO anchors.",
    "conclusion": "Opponent-only exposure to the strongest known external reference did not alter the deployed greedy fresh-zero basin. The actor changed all 146 model tensors and had finite optimizer state, yet its reachable greedy behavior remained identical to three materially different PPO treatments and significantly lost to Standard10. More PPO hyperparameter tuning or unchanged margin/temperature interventions is not justified.",
    "decision": "REJECT_OPPONENT_ONLY_STANDARD10_CURRICULUM",
    "next_step": "Run a separately logged, outcome-blind ELO-survivor selection diagnostic: freeze the terminal tournament top-rated historical snapshot chosen before new endpoint evaluation, verify it matches archived evidence, and test whether K-best selection rather than the terminal actor changes greedy breadth."
  },
